    <system:String x:Key="Design_HwInfoSHMError">If you are seeing this, InfoPanel is unable to communicate with HWiNFO via the Shared Memory Interface (SHM).</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_HwInfoSettingsEnsure">Ensure that HWiNFO is installed, running and the following are set in settings:</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_HwInfoSetting1">1. &apos;Show sensors on startup&apos; is enabled.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_HwInfoSetting2">2. &apos;Shared Memory Support&apos; is enabled.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_LibreDisabledDesc">You don&apos;t have to download LibreHardwareMonitor. If you are seeing this, it is disabled in settings. Enable Libre to get started.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_NoItemSelected">No item selected</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_QuickGuideTitle">Quick Guide:</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_QuickGuide1">Your profile defaults such as font type, size and color will be automatically set. Change them at the profiles page.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_QuickGuide2">Choose between HWiNFO (if you have it installed) or Libre. You can mix and match.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_QuickGuide3">Mouse over the icons below the sensor list to find out more.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_QuickGuide4">You can swap between sensors by clicking the swap button with a sensor and panel item selected. Works better with the duplicate function.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_TipsTitle">Tips:</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_Tips1">All updates are live not auto-saved.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_Tips2">Remember to save your changes.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_Tips3">Undo/Redo revert design steps. Reload from disk resets to the last saved file.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_Tips4">Panel items are drawn over one another in order from top to bottom. Put your background first!</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_Tips5">Right-sizing your images and gifs will significantly help to reduce resource usage.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_AdditionalNote1">This software is provided on a best effort basis. Expect bugs and/or crashes. You are encouraged to save often. You can manually backup your profiles at &apos;%localappdata%\infopanel&apos;</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_AdditionalNote2">Performance and memory usage is largely determined by the number of profiles and size of your images.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Design_AdditionalNote3">Join our discord (link in about page) for support, feature requests and to share your designs!</system:String>
